{{Quote|One of the three Legendary Swords, infused with gold.|Item}}
'''Saishi''' (formerly known as '''Saddi''') is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Saishi is arguably one of the best swords in the [[Second Sea]], due to its speed, damage, and rare ability among swords to stun even [[Blade]] users.

It is recommended to swap swords when the player reaches [[Third Sea]] however, due to there being far better options. Even still, it is still seen in builds, especially with [[Dragon Talon]].

==Obtainment==
{{Main|Legendary Sword Dealer}}
Saishi can be bought at the price of {{Money|2,000,000}} from the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]].

